WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.137 --> 00:00:02.370
- Forgive me Father, I have...

00:00:02.370 --> 00:00:03.854
sinned.

00:00:05.299 --> 00:00:08.075
Well, I think I have. I'm not sure.

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:13.035
So, it's about cats, umm...

00:00:13.035 --> 00:00:14.675
I just like 'em

00:00:14.675 --> 00:00:17.030
better than I like even me

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:20.115
and I have found that

00:00:20.714 --> 00:00:23.557
I can understand now what they're saying.

00:00:23.557 --> 00:00:25.283
(meow)

00:00:25.468 --> 00:00:26.668
And then...

00:00:26.668 --> 00:00:28.246
(meow)

00:00:28.246 --> 00:00:28.976
And...

00:00:28.976 --> 00:00:30.537
(short meow)

00:00:30.629 --> 00:00:31.360
and there's

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:33.057
(long meow)

00:00:33.057 --> 00:00:34.926
I guess it was because when I was young,

00:00:34.926 --> 00:00:37.936
I found it very difficult
to talk to girls.

00:00:37.936 --> 00:00:41.825
And then this ginger cat who was a girl

00:00:41.825 --> 00:00:44.522
came along and I just found I could,

00:00:44.522 --> 00:00:46.722
I could talk to her.

00:00:46.722 --> 00:00:48.321
Taylor Swift!

00:00:48.321 --> 00:00:49.959
I remember her TV show

00:00:49.959 --> 00:00:51.865
and she reminded me of a cat.

00:00:51.865 --> 00:00:54.801
But, I felt bad for her

00:00:54.801 --> 00:00:57.485
because she has this

00:00:58.209 --> 00:01:00.105
stupid looking cat, ya know,

00:01:00.105 --> 00:01:01.466
it's ears folded down.

00:01:01.466 --> 00:01:03.149
I tried to tell her this isn't fair.

00:01:03.149 --> 00:01:04.754
She's a lovely, lovely girl.

00:01:04.754 --> 00:01:06.786
She deserves a proper cat

00:01:06.786 --> 00:01:11.301
and I'm thinking of, maybe
buying her a proper cat

00:01:11.301 --> 00:01:14.329
and then just sort of delivering it to her

00:01:14.329 --> 00:01:15.522
one day when she's not there.

00:01:15.522 --> 00:01:17.099
You know, so that she
comes back and she sees

00:01:17.099 --> 00:01:21.951
it and she goes, "Ohh! Proper cat! Wee!!"

00:01:23.936 --> 00:01:26.094
Oh, it's you!

00:01:26.094 --> 00:01:27.535
(meow)

00:01:27.535 --> 00:01:30.690
(cat noises)

